Jehovah’s holy spirit — his active force — can effectively root out unclean “fleshly desires ” and destructive domination by our sinful flesh. To break free from bondage to wrong inclinations, it is vital that we have the help of God’s spirit, for Paul wrote: “The minding of the flesh means death, but the minding of the spirit means life and peace. ”
